# CODEOWNERS template — pushed to .github/CODEOWNERS on each repo by
# harden-github-repo.sh (or via -c to point at a different file).
#
# Use your GitHub username (or a team, if applicable), not your email:
#   @your-github-username
#   @your-org/your-team-slug
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

.github/workflows/*  @pauloba
.github/actions/*    @pauloba
Dockerfile           @pauloba
package.json         @pauloba
requirements.txt     @pauloba
